{
  "headline": "Fondaparinux sodium is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; one registered API plant was classified OAI on 2026-06-23",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E12"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include fondaparinux sodium as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label (SPL set 58789e3d) identifies two registered plants: Italfarmaco S.p.A. (FEI 1196) for analysis, labeling, manufacture, and pack, and ScinoPharm Taiwan, Ltd. (FEI 3002840477) for API manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of Italfarmaco S.p.A. ended 2023-06-28 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of ScinoPharm Taiwan, Ltd. ended 2026-06-23 and was classified OAI with seven observations including procedures for sterile drug products and validation lacking for sterile drug products.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 70 syringes at 10.6 per day for 6.6 days on hand; Corvale General holds 327 syringes at 10.7 per day for 30.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 79 syringes of 7.5 mg/0.6 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 14 days on hand while Corvale General retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers Dr. Reddy's Laboratories Limited and Eugia US LLC are not on FDA's shortage list today, but their labels name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7"]
    }
  ]
}
